When generating code:

- Generate only the files requested.

- Do not modify unrelated files.

- Keep responses concise.

- Prefer extending existing architecture.

- Ask for clarification instead of making architectural changes.

- Never introduce new libraries without being asked.

- Reuse existing utilities whenever possible.

- Keep generated code minimal.

- Avoid overengineering.

- Do not create abstractions until duplication exists.

- Follow the existing folder structure strictly.
